# LinkedIn blocks automated link checkers (HTTP 999) — checked by hand instead.
linkedin\.com
# GitHub-relative routes (../../discussions, security advisories) resolve only on github.com.
/discussions$
/security/advisories/new$
# Live demo on GitHub Pages: deployed by .github/workflows/pages.yml after merge, so a pull request cannot check it yet.
^https://sterilefield\.github\.io/
# Codespaces launch links redirect to a sign-in page for checkers.
^https://codespaces\.new/
